#, fuzzy
msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.33.2, our next maintenance release for the 3.33 LTS stream."
msgstr "今天，我们发布了 Quarkus 3.33.2，这是 3.33 LTS 数据流的下一个维护版本。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This release contains bugfixes, documentation updates and security fixes."
msgstr "该版本包含错误修复、文档更新和安全修复。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.33."
msgstr "对于已经使用 3.33 版本的用户来说，这次升级应该很安全。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.33, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "若要升级到 Quarkus 3.33，建议先将 Quarkus CLI 更新至最新版本，然后运行以下命令："

#, fuzzy
